    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waawutmo Manase waawuti'iima ngiwa iimu/ún kureeriiwós a mibaá nee tsár, ina baraá Yerusalemúr wa waawti'ín kureeri mibeeri kooán nee kooán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós tlehhma'aá tlakw gina tleéhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, tlehhmi'iidá' ta waki, awa adór kudaá mukdá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa guús geeraá múk Israeli wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa/aamedár gawaá gongoama' ar munguaá hatlá' kiwa sluufmaamisi gana male tleéhh, kudá' aáng baabuúwós Hesekia aa feé/, kiteeraá ilahhooa giri tleéhh awa munguaá Ba'ali, nee awa munguúdá' ta bay Ashera. A tí kiloseká, inós sleeme tsatse/uú gawaá doori guna sluufmiís, guri sagadiyuús. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kiteeraá munguaá hatlá' kiwa ilahhooárií hanmiisi gina tleéhh baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, didá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ iwa oó', «Baraá Yerusalemu an dír umuueé' kuwa ateetin ay alhhe'eesay wasle.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiteeraá ilahhooa kawa hanmiisi dír tsatse/ sleémeero gina tleéhh baraá afeenaadá' tsár ar Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqaywós sleeme guna ilahhooár da/tá wa hanmiís baraá xatstá garmoó Hinomu wa ale. Tlaa/e gina xuú', iigu'utu guna leelehiít, muruuduú taami ohiingw guna tsegiít, sleeme tana aldinku'umiís nee mukdá' giaá duxuúm nee da/aluuse. Inós tlakweemaá yaariir gina tleéhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, Mungú guri buhhtís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqsaydá' aa tleéhh guna qaás baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, didá' Daudi nee garmaawós Solomon Mungú ngiwa báy, «Baraá do'owihe nee baraakaá Yerusalemuro, diirí ana tsawaár baraá tlahh'iikaá mibaá nee tsár awa Israeliro tawa dír aníng tiwa sluufmiisi ay alhhe'eesay wasle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes múk Israeli adoodá' aníng naa oó', gaa tleéhh, nee iri iia looeés baraá dabe sleémeero, nee tidá' taa oó', nee tidá' ngaa bawi, tidá' naa haniís ar dákw Mose, aníng i baloó gusaaká baraá yaamuuká naa baabi'ii'ín i haniisi.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Manase muk Yuda nee oo Yerusalemu guna baraá tlakweemáy dahaás, tlakweema ngina tleehhiyé' ta kudaá xoordaá hatlá' ba/a, kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa hhaamiís geeraa múk Israelír wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Manase nee mukós gina naanaáq, ala inooín ngwa iiárií qaasi'iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ geeraharuusér waawutmoó Ashuru gana ya/aáw amór múk Yuda. Manase nguri oohiyé' gway daba' tseegiyé' ar piínguduú muqslár sirda/aten, nguri huwiyé' ay yaamaá Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár iwa baraádií dirii'i, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guna ló'wa firín, tiri ló'wa niinaweés dír geeraá Munguú baabi'iiwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú firoorós gari axaás, kunguri ki/ís Yerusalemu baraá waawuti'iimarós. Naagáy Manase gari tsaáhh adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tar Munguú ló'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá tihe Manase koo/ír hatlá' gari tleéhh daanduú tsee/aá gixsár Daudi wa ale, bihhaá /uwa awa Gihoni, baraá xatsa, nee gari alkón ay afkudá' ta bay Afkú Siyó, gari harweér ar Ofeli, koo/idá' gari ló'wa gáwtí tleés. Inós sleeme geeraharuusér slaqwaruuse gari qaás baraá umuú gixsadaá Yuda awa koo/ír gawít ngi koomá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, munguiidaá hatlá' nee murslaaqatuuwo giri hingeés, dinkwa nee kiteeriidá' aa tleéhh gawaá tloomadár Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, giri hingeés, nee baraá Yerusalemuro, giri kwaáhh tsee/aá gixsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kitángw ilahhooa oo AAKOÓ MUNGÚ guri /abeés tleehharo, nee gawaawose ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i nee ar wayda gari hanmiís. Múk Yuda guri báy, «AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguú Israeli sluufmisaak.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe, muu ina kumiít ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i hanmisuuwo wa/aameedár gawaá gongoama' ar munguaá hatlá' kiwa sluufmaamisi, ala dír ngay hanmiisiya' a dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín kilós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlehhma'aá hatlá' awa Manase, nee firoodá' Mungú nguwa firín, nee axweesanaydá' iigu'utuuse aa aaiín dirós i ale ar umuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli, kwaa gooín baraá kitaábuú alki/ituú waawituú Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Firoorós nee adoodá' Mungú firoorós ngiwa ya/án, nee tlakweemaawós sleémeero, nee inkihhimu wasleerós, nee wa/aameedár gawaá gongoama' ar munguaá hatlá' kiwa sluufmiisi ar aa tleéhh, nee adoodá' munguúdá' ta bay Ashera ngura tleéhh, nee murslaaqatuudá' taa hhaásl qoomár inós tiwa niinaweesiiká, tí sleémeero ka gooín baraá inslaslángw iigu'utuuse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Manase iri gwaá', kuri foól baraá do'ós, garmaawós Amoni iri waawuti'ín kitaangós wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoni waawuti'iimár Yuda ngiwa iimu/ún kureeriiwós a mibeeri tsár nee tsár, ina waawuti'ín baraá Yerusalemuro kureeri tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós muruú tlákw guna tleéhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, adoodá' baabuúwós Manase aa tleéhh, inós murslaaqataadá' sleémeero baabuúwós Manase aa tleéhh gina ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/ií hanmiís nee giri sagadiyuús. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós taa niinaweesiiká dír AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, adoodá' baabuúwós Manase tira niinaweés, ala Amoniwí tlakweema tlehhtuuwo gina inkaakií/.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo sagadiyuuseerós guna fuquraángwár gás baraá doó waawuti'iimárií alé. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala múk Yuda mukdaádá' Amoni gwa naaqo gaas kuri tsuú/, muu garmaawós Yosia guri qaás kitaangós wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
